      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To deepen the realism, have your \"Corner Hustler\" be a highly trusted figure within their community, perhaps of a specific, long-established ethnic background, operating within unspoken neighborhood rules. Contrast this with the \"Network Boss,\" who might be a more modern, transnational operator, embodying a different kind of urban capitalism. For the detectives, mix demographics; perhaps one detective is an outsider from a wealthier neighborhood, clashing with a seasoned local detective who truly understands the neighborhood's complex social fabric.",
